      "content": "Title: Terry Richardson. Terrence \"Uncle Terry\" Richardson (born August 14, 1965) is an American fashion and portrait photographer who has shot advertising campaigns for Marc Jacobs, Aldo, Supreme, Sisley, Tom Ford, and Yves Saint Laurent among others. He has also done work for magazines such as \"Rolling Stone\", \"GQ\", \"Vogue\", \"Vanity Fair\", \"Harper's Bazaar\", \"i-D\", and \"Vice\".",
